2 CONT *** 379 * Aschout Olsen Huusbonde 40 Givt 1te gang Bonde, gaardbeboer, medhielper og forligelses comissair M  *** 380 Borgile Tormoesdtr Hans kone 42 Givt 2dn gang K 
2 CONT ***  381 Ole Aschoutsen Deres børn 21 Ugivt Enroulleret M  
2 CONT *** 382 Tormoe Aschoutsen Deres børn 14 M 
2 CONT ***  383 Rejor Aschoutsen Deres børn 11 M  
2 CONT *** 384 Ane Aschoutsdtr Deres børn 17 K  
2 CONT *** 385 Inger Aschoutsdtr Deres børn 9 K  
2 CONT *** 386 Dorthe Aschoutsdtr Deres børn 4 K 
2 CONT ***  387 Borgile Aschoutsdtr Deres børn 1 K  
2 CONT *** 388 Brithe Knudsdtr Tjenestepiger 21 K  
2 CONT *** 389 Barbro Olsdtr Tjenestepiger 21 K  • '''Notes,''' 1814. In 1814, Asgaut was a delegate to Eidsvoll to help write the Norwegian constitution. • '''Reference:''' wikipedia. 
2 CONT ** Asgaut Olsen Regelstad (born 1761 in Finnøy, Rogaland, died 1847) 
2 CONT *** was envoy to the National Assembly at Eidsvoll in spring 1814.  Regelstad was a farmer at Reilstad in Finnøy. 
2 CONT *** He was sheriff of Finnøy 1816-1823, assistant pastor, Settlement Commissioner and he sat in the school commission and poor Commission.    In Eidsvoll, he was the only farmer from Stavanger amt. He made little of himself in the
2 CONC  debates, but he listened to those who would legislate both inheritance law and åsetesretten, and he supported a proposal to sell the church goods (the legal aid goods). He belonged to the independence party of Eidsvoll 1814.  [ht
2 CONC tp://no.wikipedia.org/wiki/Asgaut_Olsen_Regelstad]
2 CONT
2 CONT Marriages:
2 CONT * 1) Asgaut '''married Borghild Tormodsdatter ROPEID''' on 25 Jun 1780 in Finnøy, Rogaland, Norway.[1 2]
2 CONT ** '''daughter of''' Tormod Torjuson (Torgilson) ROPEID and Ingeri Johansdatter TJELMELAND, 
2 CONT ** (Borghild Tormodsdatter ROPEID was born in 1760 in Ropeid, Sand, Rogaland, Norway, baptized on 6 Jan 1761 in Sand, Rogaland, Norway 4 and died on 2 Jun 1830 in Regelstad, Finnøy, Rogaland, Norway.)
2 CONT * Marriage Notes:
2 CONT ** engaged 27 Mar 1780, [Jelsa] 
2 CONT * 2) Asgaut '''next married Brita Olsdatter KVAMME in 1837'''. (Brita Olsdatter KVAMME was born in 1805.)
2 CONT
2 CONT '''Sources:'''
2 CONT * 1 Jelsa 1768-1796 (Arkivverket), engagement #4, p85, 1780.
2 CONT * 2 Finnøy 1773-1816 (Arkivverket), p61, 1780.
2 CONT * 3 Finnøy 1746-1772 (Arkivverket), p78, rhs [6 a Trinit].
2 CONT * 4 Jelsa 1753-1767 (Arkivverket), <mangler> first page of 176, lhs.
2 CONT
