2 CONT http://www.geni.com/people/Lars-Lovra/6000000008331431741
2 CONT
2 CONT ''Trolovet 20. april 1778, bla om, vielsen står på neste side: gift 5. juli 1778 (Dom 3tia a Trinit):'' Kildeinformasjon: Rogaland fylke, Jelsa, Ministerialbok nr. A 3 (1768-1796), Ekteviede 1776-1778, side 80-81.  Permanent sidel
2 CONC enke: http://www.arkivverket.no/URN:kb_read?idx_kildeid=15816&idx_id=15816&uid=ny&idx_side=-22 - ''Lars Knutson Lovra døde allerede i februar året etter.''
2 CONT
2 CONT  ********************** http://www.choicemn.com/trees/larson-eiken/241.html
2 CONT
2 CONT ===Borghild Tormodsdatter ROPEID===
2 CONT
2 CONT * '''Born:''' 1760, Ropeid, Sand, Rogaland, Norway
2 CONT * '''Baptized:''' 6 Jan 1761, Sand, Rogaland, Norway[3] 
2 CONT * '''Marriage (1):''' Asgaut Olsen REGELSTAD on 25 Jun 1780 in Finnøy, Rogaland, Norway[1,2] 
2 CONT * '''Marriage (2):''' Lars Knudson LOVRA
2 CONT * '''Died:''' 2 Jun 1830, Regelstad, Finnøy, Rogaland, Norway at age 70
2 CONT * '''Other names''''''''' for Borghild were Borgille Tormodsdatter ROBEI and Borgile Tormoesdatter ROPEID.
2 CONT * '''Spouses/Children''': 
2 CONT **''' 1. Asgaut Olsen REGELSTAD'''
2 CONT *** Ola Asgautson REGELSTAD 2
2 CONT *** Lars Asgautson REGELSTAD
2 CONT *** Anna Asgautsdatter REGELSTAD
2 CONT *** Tormod Asgautson REGELSTAD
2 CONT *** Reier Asgautson Reilstad GISMARVIK+
2 CONT *** Ingrid Asgautsdatter REGELSTAD+
2 CONT *** Borgild Asgoutsdatter REGELSTAD
2 CONT *** Dorthe Sophia Asgautsdatter REGELSTAD
2 CONT *** Borghild Asgautsdatter REGELSTAD
2 CONT **''' 2. Lars Knudson LOVRA''' 
2 CONT
2 CONT '''Noted events in her life were:'''
2 CONT * Census: farm Regelstad, 1801, Finnøy, Rogaland, Norway. 
2 CONT * County district Parish Local parish Gard/hus 19 Stavanger Findøe Findøe Regelstad 
2 CONT * New household Given name Last name Household pos. Age Marital status Occupation Sex 
2 CONT ** 379 * Aschout Olsen Huusbonde 40 Givt 1te gang Bonde, gaardbeboer, medhielper og forligelses comissair M
2 CONT ** 380 Borgile Tormoesdtr Hans kone 42 Givt 2dn gang K 
2 CONT ** 381 Ole Aschoutsen Deres børn 21 Ugivt Enroulleret M 
2 CONT ** 382 Tormoe Aschoutsen Deres børn 14 M 
2 CONT **383 Rejor Aschoutsen Deres børn 11 M 
2 CONT ** 384 Ane Aschoutsdtr Deres børn 17 K 
2 CONT ** 385 Inger Aschoutsdtr Deres børn 9 K 
2 CONT ** 386 Dorthe Aschoutsdtr Deres børn 4 K 
2 CONT ** 387 Borgile Aschoutsdtr Deres børn 1 K 
2 CONT ** 388 Brithe Knudsdtr Tjenestepiger 21 K 
2 CONT ** 389 Barbro Olsdtr Tjenestepiger 21 K 
2 CONT * Borghild '''married Asgaut Olsen REGELSTAD, on 25 Jun 1780''' in Finnøy, Rogaland, Norway.
2 CONT ** son of Ole Asgautsen REILSTAD and Anna Reiersdatter BERGE,[1,2] 
2 CONT ** (Asgaut Olsen REGELSTAD was born in 1761 in Finnøy, Rogaland, Norway, 
2 CONT ** baptized on 28 Jun 1761 in Finnøy, Rogaland, Norway,[4]
2 CONT ** died on 8 Jan 1847 in Regelstad, Finnøy, Rogaland, Norway and 
2 CONT ** was buried in Finnøy, Rogaland, Norway.)
2 CONT * Marriage Notes:
2 CONT ** engaged 27 Mar 1780, Jelsa
2 CONT * Borghild '''next married Lars Knudson LOVRA'''. 
2 CONT ** (Lars Knudson LOVRA was born in 1779 and died in 1779.)
2 CONT
2 CONT '''Sources'''
2 CONT * [1] Jelsa 1768-1796 (Arkivverket), engagement #4, p85, 1780.
2 CONT * [2] Finnøy 1773-1816 (Arkivverket), p61, 1780.
2 CONT * [3] Jelsa 1753-1767 (Arkivverket), <mangler> first page of 176, lhs.
2 CONT * [4] Finnøy 1746-1772 (Arkivverket), p78, rhs [6 a Trinit].
2 CONT
