2 CONT * Reier '''married Anna Larsdatter GISMARVIk''', on 31 Oct 1820 in Avaldsnes, Rogaland, Norway.[1]
2 CONT ** '''daughter of''' Lars Østensen MYKLEBUST and Anne Christensdatter HARALDSEID, 
2 CONT ** Anna Larsdatter GISMARVIK was '''born in''' 1796 in Avaldsnes, Karmøy, Rogaland, Norway, 
2 CONT ** '''baptized on''' 17 Apr 1796 in Avaldsnes, Karmøy, Rogaland, Norway[3]  and 
2 CONT ** '''died on''' 14 Nov 1873 in Avaldsnes, Rogaland, Norway.)
2 CONT
