2 CONT Pg 14, Emigration to the United States by Gerhard Naeseth and Blaine Hedberg. -- Elisabeth Christiansdatter Spande (Elisabeth Christiansdotter, 23, f.) daughter of Christian Jacobsen Spande and Siri Bjørnsdatter Mjølsnes, born in 
2 CONC Finnøy, Rogaland, March 29, 1826, died in Preble Township, Fillmore County, MN, Marach 28, 1894, buried in the Scheie Lutheran Cemetery.  Emigrated from Finnøy, Rogaland to LaSalle Co. IL.  Married ca 1850 Thore Olsen Faae (1849:1
