2 CONT * Anna '''married Reier Asgautson Reilstad GISMARVIK,''' on 31 Oct 1820 in Avaldsnes, Rogaland, Norway.[1] 
2 CONT ** '''son of''' Asgaut Olsen REGELSTAD and Borghild Tormodsdatter ROPEID, 
2 CONT ** Reier Asgautson Reilstad GISMARVIK was '''born''' in 1789 in Regelstad, Finnøy, Rogaland, Norway, 
2 CONT ** on 1 Nov 1789 '''in Finnøy, Rogaland, Norway''' [3] and 
2 CONT ** '''died on''' 27 Nov 1867 in Gismarvik, Avaldsnes, Rogaland, Norway.
2 CONT
