2 CONT  ********************* http://www.choicemn.com/trees/larson-eiken/307.html
2 CONT
2 CONT '''Ole (Reierson) RICHARDSON'''
2 CONT * '''Born:''' 10 Oct 1829, Avaldsnes, Karmøy, Rogaland, Norway [3]
2 CONT * '''Baptized:''' 18 Oct 1829, Avaldsnes, Karmøy, Rogaland, Norway
2 CONT * '''Marriage''' (1): Anna Kristine Larsdatter AYGARN on 17 Apr 1855 in Avaldsnes, Rogaland, Norway [1]
2 CONT * '''Marriage''' (2): Gunhild Jonasdatter HOLMEN on 31 Aug 1901 in Avaldsnes, Rogaland, Norway [2]
2 CONT * '''Died:''' 9 Dec 1911, Preble Township, Fillmore County, Minnesota, USA at age 82 [4]
2 CONT * '''Buried:''' Choice Cemetery, Preble Township, Fillmore County, Minnesota, USA
2 CONT *   Cause of his death was probably [dilation?] of Heart.
2 CONT *   Other names for Ole were Ole Reiersen GISMARVIG, Ole Reiersen GISMARVIK, Ole REIERSON and Ole RICHARDSON.
2 CONT
