2 CONT * Cemetery: Choice Communnity Cemetery, Choice, 1911, Fillmore County, Minnesota, USA. 		
2 CONT * Ole married Anna Kristine Larsdatter AYGARN, daughter of Lars Larson ØYGARDEN and Marta Kristina Helleiksdatter ODLAND, on 17 Apr 1855 in Avaldsnes, Rogaland, Norway.[1](Anna Kristine Larsdatter AYGARN was born on 3 Jan 1833 in 
2 CONC Øygarden, Avaldsnes, Rogaland, Norway, baptized on 6 Jan 1833 in Avaldsnes, Karmøy, Rogaland, Norway, died on 5 Mar 1899 in Preble Township, Fillmore County, Minnesota, USA and was buried in Choice Cemetery, Preble Township, Fillm
2 CONC ore County, Minnesota, USA.) The cause of her death was likely TB.		
2 CONT * Ole next married Gunhild Jonasdatter HOLMEN, daughter of Jonas Bjørnson HOLMEN and Rakel Malene Rasmusdatter TANGEN, on 31 Aug 1901 in Avaldsnes, Rogaland, Norway.[2](Gunhild Jonasdatter HOLMEN was born on 18 Jan 1865 in Avaldsn
2 CONC es, Rogaland, Norway, baptized on 19 Mar 1865 in Kopervik, Avaldsnes, Rogaland, Norway,[7] died on 22 Apr 1946 in Wisconsin, USA and was buried in Polk County, Wisconsin, USA.)
2 CONT
