1 NOTE {geni:about_me} '''From Newspaper Obituary:'''
2 CONT * RUSSIAVILLE-- Miss Sarah Ryerson, 90, died at 10:30 a.m. Tuesday at her home, west of Kokomo, (Indiana).  
2 CONT * '''Born March 31, 1870, in Illinois''', 
2 CONT * she was the '''daughter of''' Christian and Enger Knudson Ryerson.  
2 CONT * She '''taught school in Illinois''' before moving to Indiana to make her home with her sister and brother-in-law, Mr. and Mrs George Dirks.  
2 CONT * She was a '''member of the Shiloh Methodist Church'''.
2 CONT * Mrs. Dirks is the only survivor of her immediate family.  
2 CONT * Six sisters and a brother preceded Sarah in death.
2 CONT * Funeral services will be held at the Stout and Son Funeral Home, Russiaville, at 2 p.m., Friday.  The Rev. August Lundquist will officiate and '''burial will be in the South Union Cemetery'''.  Friends may call at the funeral ho
2 CONC me after 2 p.m. Thursday.
2 CONT  **************************** '''Find A Grave Memorial# 108699713'''; http://www.findagrave.com/cgi-bin/fg.cgi?page=gr&GRid=108699713
