2 CONT * '''Birth:''' Jan. 11, 1877 
2 CONT * '''Death:'''  May 24, 1975
2 CONT * '''Burial:'''  South Union Cemetery in Kokomo, Howard County, Indiana, USA '''Brother/Sisters:'''
2 CONT * '''Anna S''' Ryerson Peterson (1862 - 1949)
2 CONT * '''Reese Richard''' Ryerson (1864 - 1865)
2 CONT * '''Carrie A''' Ryerson (1865 - 1875)
2 CONT * '''Ellen Josephine''' Yeager (1866 - 1926)
2 CONT * '''Bertha Christena''' Ryerson (Tina) (1867 - 1960)*
2 CONT * '''Celia''' Ryerson Cooper (1868 - 1894)*
2 CONT * '''Sarah Julia''' Ryerson (1870 - 1960)*
2 CONT * '''Richard''' Ryerson (1872 - 1956)*
2 CONT * '''Elena J''' Ryerson Langley (1875 - 1940)
2 CONT * '''Carrie Ann''' Ryerson Dirks (1877 - 1975)*
2 CONT
2 CONT '''Carrie Ann Dirks''', 98, Paxton, Ill.,
2 CONT * formerly of Burlington, 
2 CONT * '''died''' at 2:30 a.m. Saturday in the Ford County Nursing Home. 
2 CONT * She had been ill for one week.  
2 CONT * '''Born''' Jan. 11, 1877, in Ford County, Ill., 
2 CONT * she was the daughter of Christian G. and Isabelle (Knudson) Ryerson. 
2 CONT * In 1919, she married George Dirks, 
2 CONT ** who died in 1968. 
2 CONT * A resident of Burlington from 1960 to 1972, 
2 CONT * she had been a member of the Burlington United Methodist Church. 
2 CONT * She had been a resident of Howard County from 1931 to 1960 and 
2 CONT * had lived in Paxton for the past three years.
2 CONT * There are no immediate survivors.  
2 CONT * Services were Monday at Neptune Funeral Home with the Rev. Ralph Karstedt and the Rev. Henry J. Dirks officiating.  
2 CONT * Burial was in the South Union Cemetery in Howard County. 
2 CONT * '''Source:'''  Carroll County Comet, May 28, 1975   '''Family links:'''  
2 CONT *  '''Parents:'''
2 CONT ** Christian G Ryerson (1832 - 1914)
2 CONT ** Isabel Knudson Ryerson (1834 - 1926) 
2 CONT * '''Spouse:'''  George Dirks (1879 - 1968)
2 CONT * '''Siblings:'''
2 CONT ** Bertha Christena Ryerson (1867 - 1960)*
2 CONT ** Celia Ryerson Cooper (1868 - 1894)*
2 CONT ** Sarah Ryerson (1870 - 1960)*
2 CONT ** Richard Ryerson (1872 - 1956)*
2 CONT ** Carrie Ann Ryerson Dirks (1877 - 1975)
2 CONT
