1 NOTE {geni:about_me} My aunt Martha Ragnes Vogen wrote a 1984 Christmas note as follows:
2 CONT Dear Pam, Andrew, Kari & Peter,
2 CONT      Did I ever tell you that my grandmother Laurentse in Bjorheimsbygd, Norway
2 CONT lost her brother Peter when he was 7 years old? He would have inherited the 
2 CONT Nerhus farm. Since he died, Laurentse inherited the Nerhus farm and when 
2 CONT she married the local school teacher, Ivar Fister, he had to take her name and
2 CONT became Ivar Nerhus.
2 CONT       I saw his trunk with a big I.F. on each end and back in 1938 in my uncle Lars'
2 CONT home. Laurentse Nerhus was the daughter of Lars Nerhus. Her first son was Lars
2 CONT Nerhus. Lars named one son Ivar and one son Lars. Ivar Nerhus' widow was 95
2 CONT yr. old on December 8. Ivar named his son Ivar Nerhus. He was born September 9, 1931.
2 CONT       Lars named his son Ivar Nerhus. He was born March 18, 1959, and is now 25 yr. old 
2 CONT and is a cook in Jorpeland. Lars has a modern dairy farm and lives up on Holta where Tillie's
2 CONT father was born and lived. 
2 CONT       lars Nerhus' wife is Anny Nerhus and was born February 22, 1938. We visited this family
2 CONT in 1983. If you have any curiosity as to where Tillie's father Ole Holte lived when he left 
2 CONT Norway, maybe this family could find out. They live on the am that Nels Holte was born on. He
2 CONT is buried in Helmar cemetery.  My mother knew Tillie's relatives in Norway. My Grandfather
2 CONT (Ivar Nerhus) taught Tillie's uncle (Dr. Halvor Holte) who was a doctor.
