2 ADDR
1 FAMC @F6000000013082448507@
1 RFN geni:6000000003888712482
1 SUBM @S6000000003887373302@
1 NOTE
2 CONT Kari Gilbertson Lunde was born in Norway May 26, 1846 and passed away suddenly on Monday night June 24, 1918.  She came to this country around 1860 and with her parents who settled in this locality.  In 1866 she was united in marr
2 CONC iage to Rasmus Hausker.  To this union fourteen children were born, eleven of whom survive.  The children living are: Mrs. Kroshaug of Volga, SD; Mrs. Amunrud of Black Hammer; Mrs. George Ellestad and Mrs. P. L. Lind of Mabel, MN;
2 CONC  Edward of Greenbush, MN; Ole of Spring Grove and Gustav, Anton, Carl, Tilford, Oscar all residing at or near Riceford.
2 CONT Besides her husband and children, two sisters and two brothers are left to mourn her loss
2 CONT All the chidren except Mrs. Kroshaug and Edward are home to attend the funeral.  Also her sister, Mrs. Housker of Chester, Montana is here. The funeral is to be held today Friday June 28th, 1918 at Riceford with Rev. Frost officia
2 CONC ting.  Mabel Record.
1 CHAN
2 DATE 19 DEC 2018
3 TIME 21:22:05
