1 NAME Orval Norris /Olson/
2 GIVN Orval Norris
2 SURN Olson
2 _MARNM Olson
1 SEX M
1 BIRT
2 DATE 24 MAR 1920
2 PLAC Spring Grove township, Houston County, MN
2 ADDR
1 DEAT
2 DATE 9 APR 1990
