2 CONT Askel Askelson Memorial Photos Flowers Edit Share Learn about upgrading this memorial... Birth: 	Dec. 21, 1850, Norway Death: 	Oct. 1, 1921 Fayette County Iowa, USA
2 CONT
2 CONT Son of Askild Torson Steine & Haldis Olsdtr. Mehus
2 CONT
2 CONT Askel came to America from Norway in the year of 1872
2 CONT
2 CONT Askel married Bertha Serine Segadal Olson in 1876 and ten children blessed this union: Hannah (1876-?), Lars Olai (1877-1936), Bertha Talita (1880-1968), Andrew (Andrias) (1883-1918), John (1885-1957), Thomas (Thore) (1887-1889), 
2 CONC Anna Berthine (1889-1956), Theodore (1892-1966), Emma Gurina (1894-1969) & Nora Olena (1896-1996)--Births recorded in the Church records
2 CONT
2 CONT Askel died in 1921 And is buried at the First Lutheran Church Cemetery also known as the Frame Chirch
2 CONT  (bio by: Arlys Walvatne) 
