1 NOTE {geni:about_me} 
2 CONT ==Census 1875:==
2 CONT
2 CONT https://digitalarkivet.arkivverket.no/ft/person/pf01052233001722
2 CONT
2 CONT Matt immigrated to the U.S. at the age of 19 and served in the Spanish- American War, volunteering in Company "G" of Valley City, North Dakota. 
2 CONT
2 CONT Matthias and Karen raised 5 children on their Homestead in South Dakota - just 2 1/2 miles southwest of Haley, North Dakota.  Matt had a blacksmith shop in Haley which he later relocated to the Homestead.  Matt and Karen lived at 
2 CONC the Homestead until Matt's death in 1944, at which time Karen sold the farm and moved to Scranton, North Dakota.
2 CONT
